{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-rom-5-1","title":"Romans 5:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Being justified by faith, we have peace with God; 2 and joy in our hope; 8 that since we were reconciled by his blood, when we were enemies; 10 we shall much more be saved, being reconciled. 12 As sin and death came by Adam; 17 so much more righteousness and life by Jesus Christ. 20 Where sin abounded, grace did superabound.</p>\n<p>being. 9,18; 1:17; 3:22,26-28,30; 4:5,24,25; 9:30; 10:10; Hab 2:4 Joh 3:16-18; 5:24; Ac 13:38,39; Ga 2:16; 3:11-14,25; 5:4-6; Php 3:9 Jas 2:23-26 we have. 10; 1:7; 10:15; 14:17; 15:13,33; Job 21:21; Ps 85:8-10; 122:6 Isa 27:5; 32:17; 54:13; 55:12; 57:19-21; Zec 6:13; Lu 2:14; 10:5,6 Lu 19:38,42; Joh 14:27; 16:33; Ac 10:36; 2Co 5:18-20; Eph 2:14-17 Col 1:20; 3:15; 1Th 5:23; 2Th 3:16; Heb 13:20; Jas 2:23 through. 6:23; Joh 20:31; Eph 2:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-5-2","title":"Romans 5:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>By whom. Joh 10:7,9; 14:6; Ac 14:27; Eph 2:18; 3:12; Heb 10:19,20; 1Pe 3:18 wherein. 9,10; 8:1,30-39; 14:4; Joh 5:24; 1Co 15:1; Eph 6:13; 1Pe 1:4 and rejoice. 5; 8:24; 12:12; 15:13; Job 19:25-27; Ps 16:9-11; 17:15; Pr 14:32 2Th 2:16; Heb 3:6; 6:18; 1Pe 1:3-9; 1Jo 3:1-3 the glory. 2:7; 3:23; 8:17,18; Ex 33:18-20; Ps 73:24; Mt 25:21; Joh 5:24 2Co 3:18; 4:17; Re 3:21; 21:3,11,23; 22:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-5-3","title":"Romans 5:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>but we. 8:35-37; Mt 5:10-12; Lu 6:22,23; Ac 5:41; 2Co 11:23-30; 12:9,10 Eph 3:13; Php 1:29; 2:17,18; Jas 1:2,3,12; 1Pe 3:14; 4:16,17 knowing. 2Co 4:17; Heb 12:10,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-5-4","title":"Romans 5:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":5