</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-5-15","title":"Romans 5:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>But not. 16,17,20; Isa 55:8,9; Joh 3:16; 4:10 many. 12,18; Da 12:2; Mt 20:28; 26:28 much. Eph 2:8 and the gift. 6:23; 2Co 9:15; Heb 2:9; 1Jo 4:9,10; 5:11 hath. 20; Isa 53:11; 55:7; 1Jo 2:2; Re 7:9,10,14-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-5-16","title":"Romans 5:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>for the. Ge 3:6-19; Ga 3:10; Jas 2:10 but the free. Isa 1:18; 43:25; 44:22; Lu 7:47-50; Ac 13:38,39; 1Co 6:9-11 1Ti 1:13-16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-5-17","title":"Romans 5:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>For if. 12; Ge 3:6,19; 1Co 15:21,22,49 by one man's offence. or, by one offence. abundance. 20; Joh 10:10; 1Ti 1:14 gift. 6:23; Isa 61:10; Php 3:9 shall reign. 8:39; Mt 25:34; 1Co 4:8; 2Ti 2:12; Jas 2:5; 1Pe 2:9; Re 1:6; 3:21 Re 5:9,10; 20:4,6; 22:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-5-18","title":"Romans 5:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>the offence. or, one offence. upon. 12,15,19; 3:19,20 the righteousness. or, one righteousness. 3:21,22; 2Pe 1:1 all men. Joh 1:7; 3:26; 12:32; Ac 13:39; 1Co 15:22; 1Ti 2:4-6; Heb 2:9 1Jo 2:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-5-19","title":"Romans 5:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>as by one. 12-14 so by. Isa 53:10-12; Da 9:24; 2Co 5:21; Eph 1:6; Re 7:9-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rom-5-20","title":"Romans 5:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ROM","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>the law. 3:19,20; 4:15; 6:14; 7:5-13; Jo